hadiths[16]{hadithnumber,text}:
"286","[AI-translation] Hum se Muhammad bin Al-Muthanna ne riwayat ki, kahne lage: Hum se Muhammad bin Ja'far ne riwayat ki, kahne lage: Hum se Shu'bah ne, Abu Ishaq se riwayat ki, kahne lage: Maine Asim bin Damrah ko suna, woh kehte hain: Hum ne Ali se, Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke din ke waqt ki namaz ke baare mein poocha, toh unhone farmaya: Tum usko bardasht nahi kar sakte. Unka qawl hai: Hum ne kaha: Hum mein se jo bardasht karega woh padh lega. Unhone farmaya: Jab suraj idhar se hota, jaisa suraj idhar se Asr ke waqt hota hai, toh do rak'atein padh lete, aur jab suraj idhar se hota, jaisa suraj idhar se Zuhr ke waqt hota hai, toh chaar rak'atein padh lete. Aur Zuhr se pehle chaar rak'atein, aur uske baad do rak'atein, aur Asr se pehle chaar rak'atein padhte. Har do rak'at ke darmiyan qurbat wale farishton, nabiyon, aur unki taabe'een ke momineen aur musalmaanon par salam bhej kar juda karte."
"287","[AI-translation] Hum se Mahmud bin Ghaylan ne riwayat ki, kaha: Hum se Abu Dawud Tayalisi ne riwayat ki, kaha: Hum se Shu'bah ne, Yazid Ar-Rishk se riwayat ki, kaha: Maine Mu'adha ko suna, kehne lagi: Maine Aisha se poocha: Kya Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Chasht (Duha) ki namaz padhte the? Unhone farmaya: Haan, chaar rak'atein, aur jitna Allah Azza wa Jall chaheta, zyada bhi."
"288","[AI-translation] Hum se Muhammad bin Al-Muthanna ne riwayat ki, kaha: Mujhe Hakim bin Mu'awiyah Al-Ziyadi ne riwayat ki, kaha: Hum se Ziyad bin Ubaidullah bin Ar-Rabi' Al-Ziyadi ne, Humaid At-Tawil se, Anas bin Malik se riwayat ki: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Chasht ki namaz chay rak'atein padhte the."
"289","[AI-translation] Hum se Muhammad bin Al-Muthanna ne riwayat ki, kaha: Hum se Muhammad bin Ja'far ne riwayat ki, kaha: Hum se Shu'bah ne, Amr bin Murrah se, Abdur Rahman bin Abi Laila se riwayat ki: Mujhe kisi ne yeh khabar nahi di ke usne Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko Chasht ki namaz padhte dekha ho, siwaye Umm Hani ke. Unhon ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Fateh Makkah ke din unke ghar mein aaye, ghusal kiya aur aath rak'atein tasbeeh (namaz) padhi. Maine unhe (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) isse halki namaz kabhi padhte nahi dekha, magar ruku aur sajdah mukammal karte the."
"290","[AI-translation] Hum se Ibn Abi Umar ne riwayat ki, hum se Waki' ne riwayat ki, hum se Kahmas bin Al-Hasan ne, Abdullah bin Shaqiq se riwayat ki, kehte hain: Maine Aisha se kaha: Kya Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Chasht ki namaz padhte the? Unhone farmaya: Nahi, magar jab apni ghaybi (safar) se wapas aate."
"291","[AI-translation] Hum se Ziyad bin Ayyub Al-Baghdadi ne riwayat ki, kaha: Hum se Muhammad bin Rabi'ah ne, Fudail bin Marzuq se, Atiyyah se, Abu Saeed Al-Khudri se riwayat ki, kehte hain: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Chasht ki namaz padhte, yahan tak ke hum kehne lage: Ab isko chodenge nahi, aur isko chod dete, yahan tak ke hum kehne lage: Ab isko padhenge nahi."
"292","[AI-translation] Hum se Ahmad bin Mani' ne, Hushaim se riwayat ki, kaha: Hum se Ubaidah ne, Ibrahim se, Sahm bin Minjab se, Qarthi' Ad-Dabbi se, ya Qaza'ah se, Qarthi' se, Abu Ayyub Al-Ansari se riwayat ki: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) suraj dhalne ke waqt chaar rak'atein daaim padhte the. Maine kaha: Ya Rasoolullah! Aap suraj dhalne ke waqt in chaar rak'aton ko daaim padhte hain. Unhone farmaya: Asmaan ke darwaze suraj dhalne ke waqt khulte hain aur Zuhr ki namaz padhe jaane tak band nahi hote, pas main chahta hoon ke us sa'at mein mera koi neki utar jaye. Maine poocha: Kya sab mein qira'at hoti hai? Farmaya: Haan. Maine kaha: Kya unmein juda karne wala salam hai? Farmaya: Nahi. Hum se Ahmad bin Mani' ne riwayat ki, kaha: Hum se Abu Mu'awiyah ne riwayat ki, kaha: Hum se Ubaidah ne, Ibrahim se, Sahm bin Minjab se, Qaza'ah se, Qarthi' se, Abu Ayyub Al-Ansari se, Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se is ki manind riwayat ki."
"293","[AI-translation] Hum se Ahmad bin Mani' ne, Hushaim se riwayat ki, kaha: Hum se Ubaidah ne, Ibrahim se, Sahm bin Minjab se, Qarthi' Ad-Dabbi se, ya Qaza'ah se, Qarthi' se, Abu Ayyub Al-Ansari se riwayat ki: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) suraj dhalne ke waqt chaar rak'atein daaim padhte the. Maine kaha: Ya Rasoolullah! Aap suraj dhalne ke waqt in chaar rak'aton ko daaim padhte hain. Unhone farmaya: Asmaan ke darwaze suraj dhalne ke waqt khulte hain aur Zuhr ki namaz padhe jaane tak band nahi hote, pas main chahta hoon ke us sa'at mein mera koi neki utar jaye. Maine poocha: Kya sab mein qira'at hoti hai? Farmaya: Haan. Maine kaha: Kya unmein juda karne wala salam hai? Farmaya: Nahi. Hum se Ahmad bin Mani' ne riwayat ki, kaha: Hum se Abu Mu'awiyah ne riwayat ki, kaha: Hum se Ubaidah ne, Ibrahim se, Sahm bin Minjab se, Qaza'ah se, Qarthi' se, Abu Ayyub Al-Ansari se, Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se is ki manind riwayat ki."
"294","[AI-translation] Hum se Muhammad bin Al-Muthanna ne riwayat ki, kaha: Hum se Abu Dawud ne riwayat ki, kaha: Hum se Muhammad bin Muslim bin Abi Al-Waddah ne, Abd al-Karim Al-Jazari se, Mujahid se, Abdullah bin As-Sa'ib se riwayat ki: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) suraj dhalne ke baad Zuhr se pehle chaar rak'atein padhte the aur farmaya: Yeh woh sa'at hai jismein asmaan ke darwaze khulte hain, pas main chahta hoon ke usmein mera koi nek amal utar jaye."
"295","[AI-translation] Hum se Abu Salamah Yahya bin Khalaf ne riwayat ki, kaha: Hum se Umar bin Ali Al-Muqaddami ne, Mis'ar bin Kidam se, Abu Ishaq se, Asim bin Damrah se, Ali se riwayat ki: Woh Zuhr se pehle chaar rak'atein padhte the, aur zikr kiya ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) unhe zawal (suraj dhalne) ke waqt padhte the aur unmein daraaz karte."
"296","[AI-translation] Ham se Abbas Al-Anbari ne rivayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Ham se Abdur Rahman bin Mahdi ne rivayat ki, Muawiya bin Salih se, Al-Ala bin Al-Harith se, Haram bin Muawiya se, inke chacha Abdullah bin Sa'd se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) se apne ghar mein namaz aur masjid mein namaz ke baare mein poocha. Aap (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tum dekhte ho ke mera ghar masjid ke kareeb kaisa hai, pas mujhe apne ghar mein namaz padhna masjid mein padhne se zyada mehboob hai, magar ye ke namaz maktubah (farz) ho."
"297","[AI-translation] Ham se Qutayba bin Sa'id ne rivayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Ham se Hammad bin Zaid ne rivayat ki, Ayyub se, Abdullah bin Shaqeeq se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Aisha se Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ke roze ke baare mein poocha. Unhon ne kaha: Aap (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) itne roze rakhte ke hum kahen keh ab to Aap roze rakh baithe, aur iftar karte ke hum kahen keh ab to Aap iftar kar baithe. Unhon ne kaha: Aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne Madine tashreef layne ke baad koi poora mahina nahi roza rakha bajaair Ramzan ke."
"298","[AI-translation] Ham se Ali bin Hujr ne rivayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Ham se Ismail bin Jafar ne rivayat ki, Humaid se, Anas bin Malik se, ke unse Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ke roze ke baare mein poocha gaya, to unhon ne kaha: Aap (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) mahine mein itne roze rakhte ke hum samjhein keh Aap ab isme iftar nahi karna chahte, aur isme iftar karte ke hum samjhein keh Aap isme kuch roze nahi rakhna chahte. Aur tum chaaho ke raat ko Aap ko namaz padhte hue dekho to Aap ko namaz padhte hue paao, aur soyi hue dekho to soyi hue paao."
"299","[AI-translation] Ham se Mahmud bin Ghaylan ne rivayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Ham se Abu Dawud ne rivayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Ham se Shu'ba ne rivayat ki, Abi Bishr se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Sa'id bin Jubair ko farmate suna, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) itne roze rakhte ke hum kahen keh Aap ab iftar nahi karna chahte, aur iftar karte ke hum kahen keh Aap ab roza nahi rakhna chahte, aur Madine tashreef layne ke baad koi poora mahina nahi roza rakha bajaair Ramzan ke."
"300","[AI-translation] Ham se Muhammad bin Bashshar ne rivayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Ham se Abdur Rahman bin Mahdi ne rivayat ki, Sufyan se, Mansur se, Salim bin Abi Al-Ja'd se, Abi Salama se, Umm Salama se, unhon ne kahi: Maine Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ko do mahine lagataar roza rakhte nahi dekha bajaair Sha'ban aur Ramzan ke. Abu Isa ne kaha: Ye isnad sahih hai aur isi tarah kaha gaya: Abi Salama se, Umm Salama se. Aur ye hadith ek se zyada logo ne rivayat ki hai, Abi Salama se, Aisha se, Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) se, aur mumkin hai ke Abu Salama bin Abdur Rahman ne ye hadith Aisha aur Umm Salama dono se, Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) se rivayat ki ho."
"301","[AI-translation] Ham se Hannad ne rivayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Ham se Abda ne rivayat ki, Muhammad bin Amr se, unhon ne kaha: Ham se Abu Salama ne rivayat ki, Aisha se, unhon ne kahi: Maine Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ko kisi mahine mein Allah ke liye Sha'ban ke roze se zyada roza rakhte nahi dekha, Aap Sha'ban mein bajaair thore ke roze rakhte, balki Aap poora roza rakhte."
